{"ref":"BDB, מָקַק","hw":"מָקַק","html":"† <big><big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">מָקַק</span>]</big></big>  <strong>vb. decay, rot, fester</strong>, fig. <strong>pine away (</strong>NH <em>id.;</em> Aramaic (𝔗) <span dir=\"rtl\">מְקַק</span><strong>)</strong>;—<br><strong>Niph.</strong>  Pf. 3 pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">נָמַ֫קּוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 38:6\" href=\"/Psalms.38.6\">ψ 38:6</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">וְנ׳</span> consec. <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 34:4\" href=\"/Isaiah.34.4\">Is 34:4</a> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 4:17\" href=\"/Ezekiel.4.17\">Ez 4:17</a>; 2 mpl. <span dir=\"rtl\">וּנְמַקֹּתֶם</span> consec. <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 24:23\" href=\"/Ezekiel.24.23\">Ez 24:23</a>; Impf. 3 fs. <span dir=\"rtl\">תִּמַּק</span> <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 14:12\" href=\"/Zechariah.14.12\">Zc 14:12</a>; 3 mpl. <span dir=\"rtl\">יִמַּ֫קּוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 26:39\" href=\"/Leviticus.26.39\">Lv 26:39</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">יִמָּ֑קּוּ</span> v <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 26:39\" href=\"/Leviticus.26.39\">39</a>; 3 fpl. <span dir=\"rtl\">תִּמַּקְנָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 14:12\" href=\"/Zechariah.14.12\">Zc 14:12</a>; Pt. pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">נְמַקִּים</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 33:10\" href=\"/Ezekiel.33.10\">Ez 33:10</a>;— <strong>1.</strong>  <em>fester</em>, of wounds <a data-ref=\"Psalms 38:6\" href=\"/Psalms.38.6\">ψ 38:6</a> (+ <span dir=\"rtl\">הבאישׁ</span> v. <a data-ref=\"BDB, בָּאַשׁ\" href=\"/BDB,_בָּאַשׁ\", dir=\"rtl\">באשׁ</a>). <strong>2.</strong>  <em>rot, rot away</em>, <span dir=\"rtl\">עֵינָיו תִּמַּקְנָה בְחֹרֵיהֶן וּלְשׁוֹנוֹ תִּמַּק בְּפִיהֶֽם׃</span> <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 14:12\" href=\"/Zechariah.14.12\">Zc 14:12</a> (plague upon foes of Jerusalem). <strong>3.</strong>  <em>moulder away</em>, of <span dir=\"rtl\">צְבָא הַשָּׁמַיִם</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 34:4\" href=\"/Isaiah.34.4\">Is 34:4</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">וְנָגֹלּוּ כַּסֵּפֶר הַשָּׁמַיִם</span>). <strong>4.</strong>  of <em>pining away</em> by reason of <span dir=\"rtl\">(בְּ)</span>, as punishment for, iniquity <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 4:17\" href=\"/Ezekiel.4.17\">Ez 4:17</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 24:23\" href=\"/Ezekiel.24.23\">24:23</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 33:10\" href=\"/Ezekiel.33.10\">33:10</a> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 26:39\" href=\"/Leviticus.26.39\">Lv 26:39</a><sup>(×2)</sup>.<br><strong>Hiph.</strong>  Inf. abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">הָמֵק</span>, trans. <span dir=\"rtl\">ה׳ בְּשָׂרוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 14:12\" href=\"/Zechariah.14.12\">Zc 14:12</a> <em>a causing his flesh to rot</em>.","next":"BDB, מַק²","prev":"BDB, מִקְצָת"}